# Caisson Yard's builders' ramp (CIPlay caisson_yard_caves, 11-08; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe:
# the ramp's top on the flat ground at -28 12 (two boulders by it), the dug tunnel down east at 22 degrees under the
# lagoon's cliff and out at its foot on the lagoon floor round 4 12 (-8 m), the side store off it at -10 12..5 (stone,
# dirt). Flooded from a few metres in. Down from the land, out onto the lagoon floor, and back up the ramp to the land.
island Caisson Yard keep
offset -3.2334 -5.3746
hour 11
weather Calm
where Pickup_Landmark_Stone
where Pickup_Landmark_DirtPickup

# Outside: the ramp's top on the land, its foot under the cliff from the lagoon
picture cy_cave_out -38 6 12 -28 3 12
picture cy_cave_foot 12 -5 12 2 -7 12

# Down the ramp, past the side store, out onto the lagoon floor
walk -34 12 to -29 12
walk -29 12 to -20 12 to -10 12 to -2 12 to 6 12
picture cy_cave_in -24 3 12 -10 -2 12 light=20
picture cy_store -10 -1 13 -10 -2.5 5 light=20

# Back up from the lagoon floor to the land
walk 6 12 to -2 12 to -10 12 to -20 12 to -28 12 to -34 12 below=-5

# The powder cave's bear (11-13 cavemix, TODO 0f; a rat there 11-09): over the yard to the cave's mouth, the bear under its
# rock, then dealt with
walk -34 12 to -30 -20 to -24 -72 to -24 -63
expect animals Bear 1
expect animalsinside Bear 1
wait 2
picture cy_bear -24 3.6 -63 -24 2.4 -55 aim=Bear light=20
kill Bear
expect animals Bear 0
